  "id": "preoccupation",
  "term": "preoccupation",
  "definition": "Preoccupation is a persistent, excessive mental focus on a particular concern that takes up substantial time and effort. In this packet, it refers to an obsessive focus on eating in the “right” or “healthy” way, with rigid beliefs and distress when self-imposed rules are broken.",
